<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "My_life_Without_Your_Love.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\病院屋上からの風景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Warm sunlight, pouring down on the windless hospital roof.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It feels very nice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Cherry-blossom season or not, a windless day is free of April sickness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But my heart is rainy weather.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Gently, steadily, tears run down inside my heart.<PG>
Does <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> really think she needs me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My taking care of <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>... maybe it was a bother to her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or maybe <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> hates me and doesn't want to see my face...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka's</STYLE> body ending up like that is my fault, too...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> is only human too, after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Best friend or not, that doesn't mean she'll accept me unconditionally.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There are any number of bonds that break over the smallest thing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did that bond break back then, at the time of that case...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\病院屋上.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
On a bench on the empty roof, I cry by myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The rain in my heart comes out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This rain is something I can't let <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> see.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No―maybe it would be better to let her see it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe I haven't been showing <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> my true feelings.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I've been looking for you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... How did you know I was here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> told me. She said this is probably where you'd be."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was awake?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">She was awake. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, she said you seem tired, so she wants to let you rest a little."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Am I... someone </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> needs...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... doesn't she resent me...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's not...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But it's my fault...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, that's not true! I feel the same way. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">When you two ran into the mountains, if only I'd been able to give better directions..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's not true..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"If we're each telling the other 'that's not true,' then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what you're doing now is right. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">We did our best back then. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That's why </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> both survived. Isn't that good enough...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I know, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, do you know this story?"</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"This is a folk tale from Fukui Prefecture..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\共有殺人.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\昔話1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Long ago, in a certain place, there lived a young wife who had lost her husband and child, and the <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しゅうとめ">mother-in-law</STYLE>, her husband's mother.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To mourn her husband and child, the young wife went to the temple every day and kept up the memorial rites.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She was so devout and so faithful that the villagers held the young wife very dear.<PG>
But the <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しゅうとめ">mother-in-law</STYLE> did not like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She hated the young wife, hated her beyond bearing, for thinking only of her husband and child and paying no mind to her as she grew old.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\surprising_shock1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\肉付き\嫁脅し.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "11" "300" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Meaning to teach the young wife a lesson, the <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しゅうとめ">mother-in-law</STYLE> decided to put on a demon-woman mask and frighten her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\昔話3.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Going ahead to the temple where the young wife prayed every day, the <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しゅうとめ">mother-in-law</STYLE> hid in the shadows and waited for her to come.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before long, the young wife came into view.<PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5">Boo!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
 she cried, showing herself before the young wife, who was terribly startled.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Terrified, the young wife fled straight home as fast as she could.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Seeing how she reacted, the <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しゅうとめ">mother-in-law</STYLE> regretted it a little, wondering whether she had gone too far, but...<PG>
That alone would surely not be enough to get rid of that loathsome devoutness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She decided to frighten the young wife once more that night, but...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{QUAKE "アイテム1" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "500" "30"}
{QUAKE "アイテム1" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "500" "30"}
{QUAKE "アイテム1" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "500" "30"}
{MESON "500"}
No matter what she did, that demon-woman mask would not come off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It bit fast into her face, and when she tried to pull it off by force, there was a searing pain, as if the very flesh of her face were about to be <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="は">torn</STYLE> away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It won't come off―
{PAUSE ""}
It won't come off―
{PAUSE ""}
It won't come off―
{PAUSE ""}
No matter what she did, it would not come off.<PG>
As though her own face had been a terrifying demon woman's face to begin with, the mask would not come off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At her wits' end, the <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しゅうとめ">mother-in-law</STYLE> could not even go home, and she regretted having put on the mask to frighten the young wife.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\昔話1.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Meanwhile, when the young wife got home, the <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しゅうとめ">mother-in-law</STYLE> was not there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even when night came, she did not come back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The young wife decided to search for the <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しゅうとめ">mother-in-law</STYLE> together with the villagers.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\昔話3.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
As the young wife was searching a <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="たけやぶ">bamboo grove</STYLE> near the temple, from somewhere there came a sound of weeping she knew.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no mistaking it. It was the <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しゅうとめ">mother-in-law's</STYLE> voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When she walked over toward the owner of the voice―
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\肉付き\嫁脅し.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
there was that demon woman who had appeared before her that afternoon.<PG>
The <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しゅうとめ">mother-in-law</STYLE> wept and begged the young wife to help her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The young wife suggested at once that they go to the temple and ask for help.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even the <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しゅうとめ">mother-in-law</STYLE>, who had always denied the Buddha, was desperate enough this time to clutch at <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="わら">straws</STYLE>, and she decided to consult the head priest of the temple.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\昔話2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The head priest spoke.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="9" RUBY="ささ">Offer</STYLE> your prayers to the Buddha. 
{PAUSE ""}
And regret what you have done, and <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="ざんげ">repent</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
Then the Buddha will forgive you and lift that curse," he said.<PG>
Just as she was told, the <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しゅうとめ">mother-in-law</STYLE> chanted the nembutsu with all her might, <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="ざんげ">repented</STYLE> of what she had done to the young wife, and apologized.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then, what do you think happened?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n200\r\n200\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n200\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n200\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯落とす.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
The mask that had bitten into her face slipped smoothly off and dropped to the floor with a soft plop.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
From then on, it is said, the <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しゅうとめ">mother-in-law</STYLE> went to the temple every day with the young wife for the husband and child, and devoutly performed the memorial rites.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "My_life_Without_Your_Love.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\病院屋上.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"This is a story from Fukui Prefecture called 'The Flesh-Bound Mask.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The details differ depending on the storyteller, but the point is that she was saved by casting off her hatred and affirming the Buddha."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Why tell that story to me...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Are you saying that if I believe in what I'm doing, I'll be saved someday?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Of course, there's that meaning too, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">My interpretation is a little different. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11" RUBY="しゅうとめ">The mother-in-law</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had a demon woman's heart even before she put on the mask, and putting on the mask only gave the demon's heart a form. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">In other words, even without the mask, the mother-in-law was already a demon woman."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............?"</STYLE><PG>
