{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
<BR>
The students who drew a loaded piece gasp for something to drink and order more sweet drinks.<PG>
But college students' momentum doesn't stop at that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides the seven who took the challenge, there are brave souls who try the leftover wasabi sushi just for the fun of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Those brave souls, all their gusto for nothing as they go down in flames, have no choice but to order more drinks.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This way, the average spend per customer goes up, and on top of that, they remember this shop.<PG>
By the way, according to <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>, the customers' chance of winning Sushi Survival is only about 0.03%.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Naturally, no group has made it through this survival so far.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With college groups, this survival menu usually gets ordered on a drunken whim.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm glad I found some good prey today too.<PG>
