{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Outside, it's growing faintly light.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This nightlife district, so noisy at night, is wrapped in a brief stillness in the glow of dawn.<PG>
"Well, <STYLE ID="3">Nat-chan</STYLE>, good work today too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Good work today, Boss!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, right, right, <STYLE ID="3">Nat-chan's</STYLE> hourly pay is going up again starting next month."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Really!?"</STYLE><PG>
"Ever since <STYLE ID="3">Nat-chan</STYLE> came, we've had lots of customers! I can't keep paying you just a part-timer's wages, can I! 
{PAUSE ""}
　If somebody poached you, we'd lose a whole bunch of customers all at once."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ah ha ha! I'm planning to stay on here for a while yet, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, in that case... 
{PAUSE ""}
if you're up for it, I'd like <STYLE ID="3">Nat-chan</STYLE> to be the manager of the second store."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"The second store!?"</STYLE><PG>
"Yeah, at the rate things are going, it looks like we can open a branch by the station in six months. 
{PAUSE ""}
We'll handle the kitchen staff and all that on our end, so I want to leave running the second store to <STYLE ID="3">Nat-chan</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"But I'm... a high-school dropout, and I don't have any education..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3">Nat-chan</STYLE> pulls in lots of customers and brings us profit. 
{PAUSE ""}
Not just anyone can do that. It's because <STYLE ID="3">Nat-chan</STYLE> came to us."<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But... for me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Is it your friend in the hospital...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see... There's no guarantee she'll be able to walk in six months, huh..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE><PG>
"Well, still, if things allow in six months, think it over for me, okay? 
{PAUSE ""}
Even if not, as long as you keep doing what you've been doing, there's no problem. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Nat-chan</STYLE>, you're this shop's star girl. Because you're here, <STYLE ID="3">Nat-chan</STYLE>, we get to make a <STYLE ID="21" RUBY="もう">profit</STYLE> too. 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm counting on you from here on too!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Yes, Boss! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　No―once the second store opens, it's 'President,' isn't it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ha ha ha! I'd rather you kept calling me Boss, at least!"<PG>
―Once the shutters close, the manager and I head off in separate directions, on our way home.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see... I really was contributing to the shop.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So all those customers on weekdays only started after I came.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I can do isn't only taking care of <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Here too, there was a way I could be useful.<PG>
Okay, I have to work even harder!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I head for the Goto home with a light step.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm happy to be praised like this for what I've achieved.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm happy to be treated the way I deserve.<PG>
